      "endLine": 163,
      "source": "memory",
      "snippet": "客户某业务使用的MySQL单实例运行，存在较大的安全风险，需要搭建主备架构满足高可用的要求。由于业务的特殊性，需要确保数据不丢失。考虑到当前版本为5.7，决定采用半同步方案。 ## 二、步骤 1、安装备库 ``` rpm -ivh mysql-community-common-5.7.41-1.el7.x86_64.rpm rpm -ivh mysql-community-libs-5.7.41-1.el7.x86_64.rpm rpm -ivh mysql-community-libs-compat-5.7.41-1.el7.x86_64.rpm rpm -ivh mysql-community-devel-5.7.41-1.el7.x86_64.rpm rpm -ivh mysql-community-client-5.7.41-1.el7.x86_64.rpm rpm -ivh mysql-community-server-5.7.41-1.el7.x86_64.rpm ``` 2、修改配置文件 ``` [mysqld] #innodb_buffer_pool_size = 2G #innodb_buffer_pool_instances = 2 enforce_gtid_consistency = ON gtid_mode = ON #innodb_log_file_size=512MB #innodb_log_files_in_group=3 #log-bin=mysql-bin server_id=2 #同",
